<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Release on Wayne's blog | 偉恩的部落格 | 技術博客</title><link>https://wayne-blog.com/tags/release/</link><description>Recent content in Release on Wayne's blog | 偉恩的部落格 | 技術博客</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-tw</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 24 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://wayne-blog.com/tags/release/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Node v19 正式發布</title><link>https://wayne-blog.com/2022-10-24/nodejs-v19-release/</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://wayne-blog.com/2022-10-24/nodejs-v19-release/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52449163172_6f0c5b3278_o.jpg" alt="Featured image of post Node v19 正式發布" /&gt;&lt;style&gt;
